EQUIVALENT FX-CMP-006  -- proved, not searched for: in fx.divergence_bps the guard `stated_aud <= 0` becomes `< 0`.  The two differ only at stated_aud == 0, where the mutant goes on to fmath.bps_of(reference_aud - 0, 0).  bps_of returns None for every denominator <= 0 (apg/fin/fmath.py, first line of its body), which is exactly what the guard returned.  Pinned by test_fin_arith (bps_of with 0 and a negative denominator), test_mkt_fx_fresh (divergence_bps(100, 0)) and test_mkt_edges_base (a stated conversion of zero or less).
